ven Back Alley\",\n              \"location_end_label\": \"Oakhaven Back Alley\",\n              \"location_start\": \"A dim, cobblestone alleyway behind the merchant stalls\",\n              \"location_end\": \"A dim, cobblestone alleyway behind the merchant stalls\",\n              \"transition_in_text\": \"Artie approaches the glowing premium chest tucked behind a stack of discarded crates.\",\n              \"transition_in_anchors\": [\n                \"glowing premium chest\",\n                \"discarded crates\",\n                \"alley shadows\"\n              ],\n              \"transition_out_text\": \"Artie raises his rusty dagger and strikes the heavy iron padlock with all his nonexistent strength.\",\n              \"transition_out_anchors\": [\n                \"rusty iron dagger\",\n                \"heavy iron padlock\",\n                \"glowing chest lid\"\n              ],\n              \"handoff_mode\": \"direct_continuation\",\n              \"constraint_state\": \"free\",\n              \"consumes_outcome_from\": \"2:1\",\n              \"hands_off_to\": \"2:3\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"scene_id\": 3,\n              \"type\": \"climax\",\n              \"summary\": \"The lock shatters instantly, allowing Artie to loot the Cloak of the Cowardly Lion just as the noise attracts unwanted attention.\",\n              \"outcome\": \"Artie steals the Cloak of the Cowardly Lion from a locked starter chest.\",\n              \"characters\": [\n                \"CHAR_ARTIE\",\n                \"CHAR_FIZZ\"\n              ],\n              \"location_start_label\": \"Oakhaven Back Alley\",\n              \"location_end_label\": \"Oakhaven Crypt Entrance\",\n              \"location_start\": \"A dim, cobblestone alleyway behind the merchant stalls\",\n              \"location_end\": \"The crumbling stone steps leading down to the city crypts\",\n              \"transition_in_text\": \"The heavy iron padlock shatters into digital 